  "change": "DEV3 08-2b (dev3-cursor-locator.md#locator, #implementation-2b): C RowLocator, the bounded physical hint cache of B's point read. Each locator takes one of the core's LOCATOR_SHARES (32) shares of 32,768 B, so a session's live locators stay within the existing 1 MiB locator allocation (dev3-concurrency-admission.md#locator-shares: lock-free byte ledger, no admission order, Drop returns, core size unchanged); key = whole anchor PageIdentity + RowId; a hit loads the hinted leaf and checks the RowId, else re-routes from the root and must confirm the hint; a recorded revision above the current one, bounds not holding the RowId or a differing recheck are fatal Invariant; another core's table is BindingMismatch before any read. Credits schedule 08-2 (35 -> 36/86) on merge.",
